Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.97,0:00:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.71,0:00:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.05,0:00:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.23,0:01:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.91,0:01:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.75,0:01:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.65,0:01:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.57,0:01:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.89,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.29,0:01:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.23,0:01:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you\Nif you want to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.15,0:01:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.43,0:01:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.03,0:01:56.28,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(726,728)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(684,726,\1a&H00&)\t(5522,5564,\1a&HFF&)}Captain Kuro
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.03,0:01:56.28,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(726,728)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Captain Kuro
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.87,0:01:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't call it murder, Tang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.87,0:01:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like the sound of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.19,0:01:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.11,0:02:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an accident that you planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.73,0:02:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what are those guys talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.31,0:02:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.83,0:02:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we listen a little\Ncloser, we can find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.41,0:02:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't simply kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.39,0:02:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is critical to our plan that Miss\NKaya perishes in an unfortunate accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't screw that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.69,0:02:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So basically, on your signal,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.63,0:02:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the men and I stormed\Nthe village and manage
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to accidentally kill the little rich girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.47,0:02:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you get her inheritance\Nand we all get paid, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ignorance is astounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.43,0:02:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not related, so how could\NI inherit anything from her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.91,0:02:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll work very hard to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Django, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.51,0:02:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the most important part.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.37,0:02:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you kill her, you'll use your\Nhypnosis to make Kaya write her will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.73,0:02:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it will say I leave my entire\Nfortune to my butler, Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then and only then will I have undisputed\Ncontrol of her enormous fortune,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.41,0:02:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and no one will suspect a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have spent three long years gaining\Nthe trust of everyone around me so that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.95,0:03:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be unsurprising for her to leave\Nthe entirety of her inheritance to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.15,0:03:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three years as a butler for this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure had us scared\Nback then, Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.19,0:03:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three years ago, you suddenly said\Nyou were giving up life as a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In no time at all, you set\Nup someone to be your double.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.95,0:03:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you let the world see\NCaptain Kuro get executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.35,0:03:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only now do I understand that was\Njust the beginning of this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.17,0:03:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the man of a thousand plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never call me that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.53,0:03:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I abandoned that name years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.01,0:03:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I now wish to obtain my wealth without\Nattracting the attention of the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, I'm a pacifist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.31,0:04:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pacifist you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.09,0:04:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Murdering an entire family doesn't\Nexactly qualify as peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.87,0:04:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.85,0:04:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't murdered an entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The father's death wasn't planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say, it\Nmakes no difference to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.87,0:04:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's all the same to you,\Nhurry up and give the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crew is getting bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been wading in the waters\Nnear here for over a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.37,0:04:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the men are growing\Nmore anxious by the minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.07,0:04:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.85,0:04:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it bad guy stuff? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.69,0:04:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening to any of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.19,0:04:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys aren't just bad, they're evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro is known to be the most\Ndevious, skimming pirate around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though he's known for his smarts,\Nhe's legendary for his brutality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:04:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Word had it that the Marines caught\Nand executed him three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Captain Kuro is alive and well,\Nposing as Klahadore the butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.39,0:05:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's had his diabolical sights set on\NKaya's fortune for the last three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.11,0:05:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, they'll attack the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.73,0:05:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll kill Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.25,0:05:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.71,0:05:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is seriously bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.69,0:05:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get down! They'll see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better stay away from that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've spotted you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up and hide before they\Ndecide you need a long, slow death!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.43,0:05:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now, if it isn't Usopp,\Nthe mischievous town liar...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.77,0:05:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.77,0:05:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm spotted, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.45,0:05:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, no, nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't hear a peep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.03,0:05:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we didn't hear\Nanything about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.41,0:05:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:05:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.31,0:06:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay attention, boys, and\Nwatch this ring closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.19,0:06:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.31,0:06:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the count of Jango, you\Nwill be in a deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.29,0:06:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, run for cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, he's going to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.95,0:06:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jango!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.21,0:06:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jango, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you're still\Nfalling asleep on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.41,0:06:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.97,0:06:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had to go and fall\Noff a cliff, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.07,0:06:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pity, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.07,0:06:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.31,0:06:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no way he could have survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.89,0:06:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.07,0:06:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I take care of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.37,0:07:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything he could say\Nwould sound like lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jango, tomorrow at daybreak, the\Nmen are to attack the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.69,0:07:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rough up the villagers some and tear up\Ntheir homes a little for good measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.39,0:07:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And above all, make sure Miss\NKaya's death looks accidental.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.41,0:07:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just accept it, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.53,0:07:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is nothing you can say or do to warn\Nthe villagers of this impending tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.57,0:07:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My plans are flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.19,0:07:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.91,0:07:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the village I\Ngrew up with is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kaia's going to be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.31,0:07:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.73,0:08:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Usopp, brave warrior of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard you've been a little down lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I thought I'd tell you\Na story to cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.07,0:08:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would do well to\Nmind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.59,0:08:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please leave or I'll call\Nsomeone who will make you leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.11,0:08:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.11,0:08:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.59,0:08:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fought, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain! Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought Luffy was\Nsupposed to be with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.05,0:08:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.67,0:08:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he still at the shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, he looked really upset. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.83,0:08:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still mad at the butler?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.29,0:08:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that wasn't just a mad face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.91,0:08:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That look was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.49,0:09:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a tragic face of sheer desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.61,0:09:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you guys show us\Nthe way to get down to that shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.87,0:09:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This smells like an adventure to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.11,0:09:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, something happened at the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.37,0:09:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this calls for the use of pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.71,0:09:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we get to this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.87,0:09:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terrible news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.79,0:09:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.70,0:09:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.79,0:09:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't set a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.07,0:09:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow morning they're\Ngoing to attack the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.35,0:09:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.77,0:09:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.91,0:09:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.93,0:09:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.85,0:09:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:09:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're putting a stop to this here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.33,0:10:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.27,0:10:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.99,0:10:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the truth this\Ntime, I promise. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.17,0:10:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all know that you're\Nnothing but a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would do you some good to follow\NClawdor's example of hard work and honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything he could say\Nwould sound like lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.77,0:10:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what\NClawdor is counting on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ignored me because he\Nknew no one would believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.53,0:10:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are these to your liking, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.93,0:10:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Custom made to your exact specifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.29,0:10:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was quite a trip to get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.21,0:10:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for traveling\Nso far to get them for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a gift, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.31,0:10:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes. As of tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:11:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it will be exactly three years to\Nthe day since Klahadore arrived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's always taken good care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.63,0:11:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be delighted to\Nreceive such a lovely gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.93,0:11:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please hear me out, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.37,0:11:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our lives depend on it! Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are going to attack\Nthe village in the morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.71,0:11:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we believed every\Nstory you ever told us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.05,0:11:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we would have run screaming from the\Nvillage hundreds of times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.00,0:11:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.71,0:11:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying this time. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.77,0:11:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.01,0:11:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll murder you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.61,0:11:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be lucky if we don't murder you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him! Don't let him escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.81,0:11:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After three long years of absence, I\Nmade the call for my men and you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your loyalty will be richly rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.91,0:12:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I intend on being more than generous\Nwhen I divide the take at dawn tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.65,0:12:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy the village to\Nyour heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.73,0:12:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are going to attack the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.45,0:12:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they're going to kill Kaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.39,0:12:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.65,0:12:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No question about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.61,0:12:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what made you think it'd\Nbe a good time for a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.19,0:12:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember going to sleep\Nor getting down here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.97,0:12:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This proves that Klahadore is a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.37,0:12:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp saw right through him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's on his way\Nto warn the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.19,0:12:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they'll have time to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.83,0:12:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those stupid pirates won't hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.09,0:12:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the town will be abandoned\Nby the time they get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.57,0:12:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.85,0:12:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better run away\Ntoo if we want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.01,0:12:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's pack our\Ntreasure and run like the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.91,0:12:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.49,0:13:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to stock up before\Nthe meat shop guy leaves
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.17,0:13:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, that's not really\Nthe issue at hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.33,0:13:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.55,0:13:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh god, i was worried\Nyou wouldn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.21,0:13:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, run kaya, they're gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.85,0:13:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.76,0:13:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's tricked the entire village,\NClador's really a deadly pirate captain
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this a story?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well I don't like this one
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.75,0:13:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't one of my\Nstories, it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.97,0:13:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard it with my own ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.17,0:14:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clawdor is a pirate captain\Nwho weaseled his way into
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.51,0:14:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your family's home so he\Ncould steal your fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.51,0:14:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's pretended to be your\Nbutler for three years
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.93,0:14:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he could kill you\Nand inherit your money?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.93,0:14:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His crew is going to raid the\Nvillage at dawn and in the process,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going to get killed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.79,0:14:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clawdor is a very bad man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.65,0:14:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.95,0:14:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.29,0:14:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did treat you harshly earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.69,0:14:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I understand that you're\Nhurt, but lying like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's not like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.41,0:14:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I loved them. Every one. One.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.03,0:14:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All those lies you told me,\Nthey brought joy to my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.07,0:14:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is just vengeful poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:14:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya, please, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.93,0:15:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not just trying to\Nget back at Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.51,0:15:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that? It's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.83,0:15:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya, is everything okay up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.59,0:15:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.93,0:15:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.01,0:15:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unhand her immediately, you villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please trust me, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.31,0:15:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to get out of this\Nvillage before that butler gets back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.69,0:15:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise this will all make sense\Ntomorrow, but right now we need to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.09,0:15:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya, please, please, trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.09,0:16:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kai alone, you maniac!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let that lunatic get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.61,0:16:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He broke in and tried to\Nkidnap the lady of the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.37,0:16:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.35,0:16:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't anyone believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.61,0:17:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, there, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.79,0:17:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.55,0:17:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how's it going, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.81,0:17:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain! What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're alive again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.65,0:17:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.59,0:17:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I had a pretty good nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.81,0:17:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was sleeping the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.57,0:17:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, we heard all about those\Npirates and their evil plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.55,0:17:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better hurry and warn the people in\Nthe village so they have time to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.41,0:17:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warn the people?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:17:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.99,0:18:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.90,0:18:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all know you're nothing but a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, obviously I'm lying like usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.83,0:18:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That butler made me so\Nmad with what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.35,0:18:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd get him back\Nand say that he was a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.73,0:18:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You put the Straw Hat guy up to it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you've really\Ndisappointed me. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.43,0:18:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though that Butler guy is a jerk,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.51,0:18:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were better\Nthan lying to hurt someone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I admired you for being\Nsuch a kind-hearted person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.73,0:18:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I think we respected\Nyou this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.43,0:18:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.55,0:18:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's supper time anyways. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.09,0:18:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:18:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lied to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because all I do is lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way anybody was going\Nto believe what I had to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.93,0:19:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because what you were telling\Nthem was the honest truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.19,0:19:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are coming, and they're\Ngoing to level this whole town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.49,0:19:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.75,0:19:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll think I'm lying\Nif I try to warn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the village thinks that tomorrow's\Njust going to be another normal day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.21,0:19:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They think I'm lying, and\Nthat's all they need to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stop those pirates\Nat the beach tomorrow myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault for being\Nsuch a liar. I don't care anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.97,0:19:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if they drive me away with brooms\Nor shoot me in the arm this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.87,0:19:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is my village it's my home and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love everyone in it I have to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.99,0:19:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,protect them you're a hell of\Na good guy sending your cronies
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.23,0:19:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,away and going into battle alone\Njust so you know I have dibs on
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.01,0:20:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the pirate treasure you got\Nit so you want a little help or
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.21,0:20:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what you guys you're gonna help\Nme fight all these pirates I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.47,0:20:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't get it well you said there's\Na whole bunch of bad guys right
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.73,0:20:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you look scared out of your\Nmind for your information I have
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.79,0:20:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nerves of steel I'm perfectly okay\Nwith tons of bad guys after all
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.57,0:20:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're looking at the legendary\NCaptain Usopp brave warrior of
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.69,0:20:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,High seas, all right? Fine. I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why shouldn't i be there captain
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,curls man these guys mean business\Ni don't need pity if you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.39,0:20:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are sticking around because you\Npity me just leave i don't need
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.31,0:20:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you laughing at me we're not\Nlaughing at you we're helping because
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are honorable you really think\Nwe risk our lives out of pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.75,0:20:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.29,0:21:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find my way to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.57,0:21:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.45,0:21:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.07,0:21:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.55,0:21:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.71,0:21:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.11,0:21:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the world never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.87,0:21:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.13,0:22:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could return to the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.81,0:22:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When everything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.25,0:22:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.79,0:22:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.31,0:22:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

